                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Editorial Note</hi></head>
                <p>The only record that has been found of this meeting, aside from the entry in the
                    Log, <hi rendition="#italic">ante</hi>, <ref target="#pg660">p. 660</ref>, is
                    the reference to it which appears in a telegram of December 12, 1943, from the
                    Ambassador to the Greek Government-in-Exile in Egypt (MacVeagh) to the Secretary of State, <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >post</hi>, <ref target="#pg844">p. 844</ref>.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
